== Tips ==

* Using the {{Item|Super Sharp 'n Stabby Steak Stake}} allows to reduce the kill requirement to spawn the {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}} from {{Green|10}}/{{Green|15}}/{{Green|20}}/{{Green|25}}/{{Green|30}} kills per tier to {{Green|7}}/{{Green|10}}/{{Green|14}}/{{Green|17}}/{{Green|20}}.
** With a {{Item|Perma-Jelled Garlic-Flavored Re-Heated Gummy Polar Bear}}, this can be further reduced to {{Green|7}}/{{Green|10}}/{{Green|13}}/{{Green|16}}/{{Green|19}}.

== Trivia ==
*The {{AN|Bloodcrave}} ability's {{Stat|Damage}} bonus only applies to hits from the '''Super Sharp 'n Stabby Steak Stake''' itself.
**It applies even if another hit with a different weapon was performed in meantime.
*If the player deals enough damage to kill a Vampire above {{Stat|Health|20%}}, it does not trigger the {{AN|Bloodcrave}} ability.

